        "format": "",
        "indent": 0,
        "version": 1,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "direction": "ltr",
            "format": "",
            "indent": 0,
            "version": 1,
            "textFormat": 0,
            "textStyle": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "version": 1,
                "text": "Yes. When you're ready to scale beyond a solo practice, upgrading to Enterprise is seamless — your data, templates, and client history all carry over. Contact our team and we'll handle the transition.",
                "format": 0,
